# Roboter Studio manual control — hand-guide toggle. enabled=true torques the
# follower OFF so the student can move it by hand (same limp-arm mechanism as the
# calibration touch-off), and opens a manual session (on_manual). enabled=false
# is the universal "exit manual mode": it aborts any in-flight jog/replay, re-
# torques the follower (fail-loud — the mutex is kept held if the re-torque
# fails, so no later mode drives a limp arm) and closes the manual session.
bool enabled
---
bool success
string message
